      "content": "thanks, those are a good start. i want to get even more specific with the demographics though. to make the world feel lived-in, i don't want them to all be the same. can you take those archetypes and give them some more specific identities? like, describe their physical appearance, what kind of neighborhood they'd be from, and maybe their ethnicity or background so i can cast them in my head. i want the \"street level\" guys to look and feel like they actually belong in a rough, urban setting.",
